WEBVTT

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.391
that maybe somehow
no one would ever figure out

00:12:30.415 --> 00:12:32.009
that it was me.

00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:35.802
But despite all that emotion
and all that volatility,

00:12:35.826 --> 00:12:37.145
I still did it,

00:12:37.169 --> 00:12:40.344
and luckily, it triggered an investigation

00:12:40.368 --> 00:12:41.638
that shown to light

00:12:41.662 --> 00:12:44.008
that there were huge
deficiencies in the lab,

00:12:44.032 --> 00:12:47.323
and it stopped Theranos
from processing patient samples.

00:12:47.347 --> 00:12:54.347
(Applause)

00:12:56.039 --> 00:12:59.381
So you would hope,
going through a very challenging

00:12:59.405 --> 00:13:01.777
and crazy situation like this,